                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This week, I spoke on the importance of federal nutrition programs for Central Texas at the 2024 Prosper Waco Summit. Prosper Waco is dedicated to improving education, health, and financial security for our community, and as a proud Waco native, I enjoyed sharing my insights. I highlighted the role of the Farm Bill, which many view as primarily focused on agriculture, but is actually the largest piece of federal legislation supporting food security. The Nutrition Title of the Farm Bill is crucial for enhancing access for families and modernizing food distribution. I am fully supportive of the Farm Bill and the potential impact it has in our communities.",
